{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Media AGENCY Simulator is a humorous management simulation where you build and run your own media agency. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give tasks to your employees to produce accurate news content, check the facts of incoming stories, and publish them on your platform. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your follower base grows, expand your team, establish a presence on different social media platforms, and develop your strategy to reach the top of the media world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Office</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your office layout! As you grow your agency, you can unlock and purchase new offices, each with a unique <strong>layout design</strong>. Every new office offers a different workspace and setup to suit your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980140/extras/5ebcb384f6892d969d73680d5d9b7255.poster.avif?t=1768644124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980140/extras/5ebcb384f6892d969d73680d5d9b7255.webm?t=1768644124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980140/extras/5ebcb384f6892d969d73680d5d9b7255.mp4?t=1768644124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Employee Morale</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employee morale plays a critical role in your agency's success. Your office decor and working conditions directly affect your team members' motivation. As morale drops, employees' tendency to slack off increases and work efficiency decreases. Keep your team happy by providing a better office environment and get the best news from them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980140/extras/ec14a05818ba8a2a5c34d1f82efcf278.poster.avif?t=1768644124\" width=780 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980140/extras/ec14a05818ba8a2a5c34d1f82efcf278.webm?t=1768644124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Motivation Touches</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The control of your agency is always in your hands! From the main computer in the Manager Office, you can instantly track the progress of your employees' tasks. You can easily see who is at their desk and who is sneaking off. When you see a lazy employee, act immediately. Find the slacking employee in the office and give them a little &quot;Motivation Touch.&quot; Sometimes, a small reminder is the fastest way to increase productivity. Remember, a tidy office means more news!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980140/extras/f925304f4c6666641fc46533c46aaa11.poster.avif?t=1768644124\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980140/extras/f925304f4c6666641fc46533c46aaa11.webm?t=1768644124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980140/extras/f925304f4c6666641fc46533c46aaa11.mp4?t=1768644124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3980140?t=1768644124","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3980140?t=1768644124","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980140/cdb345e22afd80edf0cc76d9d912eaa3ab142919/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768644124","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980140/cdb345e22afd80edf0cc76d9d912eaa3ab142919/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768644124","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Media AGENCY Simulator is a humorous management simulation where you build and run your own media agency. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give tasks to your employees to produce accurate news content, check the facts of incoming stories, and publish them on your platform. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your follower base grows, expand your team, establish a presence on different social media platforms, and develop your strategy to reach the top of the media world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Office</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your office layout! As you grow your agency, you can unlock and purchase new offices, each with a unique <strong>layout design</strong>. Every new office offers a different workspace and setup to suit your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980140/extras/5ebcb384f6892d969d73680d5d9b7255.poster.avif?t=1768644124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980140/extras/5ebcb384f6892d969d73680d5d9b7255.webm?t=1768644124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980140/extras/5ebcb384f6892d969d73680d5d9b7255.mp4?t=1768644124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=